ment-container\">\n        \n        <h1 class=\"main-title\">怀孕2个月 (5-8周)</h1>\n\n        <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n            主补营养素：<span class=\"nutrient\">维生素C、维生素B6</span>，缓解牙龈出血、抑制妊娠呕吐\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">🥬</span>\n                <span class=\"section-title\">维生素C的来源：</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"section-content\">\n                新鲜的水果蔬菜，比如，青椒、菜花、白菜、蕃茄、黄瓜、菠菜、柠檬、草莓、苹果等。\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">🍯</span>\n                <span class=\"section-title\">维生素VB6的来源：</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"section-content\">\n                在麦芽糖中含量最高，每天可以吃1-2勺麦芽糖。\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">🥩</span>\n                <span class=\"section-title\">富含维生素B6的来源：</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"section-content\">\n                植物性食品：香蕉，马铃薯，黄豆，胡萝卜，核桃，花生，菠菜等。\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"section-content\">\n                动物性食品：瘦肉，鸡肉，鸡蛋，鱼等含量较多。\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"table-container\">\n            <table>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"col-week\">第5周</td>\n                        <td>饮食同第四周相同。</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"col-week\">第6周</td>\n                        <td>孕妇要多食海带，其它食物自便。这是为胎儿大脑发育着想。</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"col-week\">第7周</td>\n                        <td>大量食米及豆类，尤其是豆腐，为胎儿的肉质发育做准备。</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"col-week\">第8周</td>\n       